WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:02,480
Brother, that's enough

2
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:04,150
take care of yourself

3
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:05,630
Thank you little master

4
00:00:05,630 --> 00:00:07,190
I can't accept this cause of death

5
00:00:07,190 --> 00:00:12,860
But I understand

6
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:13,860
some complaints

7
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:15,640
It follows people for life

8
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:17,930
long time no see

9
00:00:17,930 --> 00:00:20,250
When my mother goes to the toilet

10
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:21,410
He fell and left

11
00:00:21,410 --> 00:00:23,250
Your sister-in-law is pregnant

12
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:25,490
It would be nice if my sister came back

13
00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:27,410
I hope not

14
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:29,630
she can have a better life

15
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:35,120
Why did you open the door?

16
00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:36,400
My old man left today

17
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,360
There is a coffin at home

18
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:38,800
But there are no plants or anything like that.

19
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:41,330
Unruly

20
00:00:41,330 --> 00:00:43,600
Get me one of these

21
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:45,280
You can't get the same one

22
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:47,120
The man died and the horse was burned, the woman died and the cow was burned.

23
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:49,160
Colors and types are particular

24
00:00:49,160 --> 00:00:50,920
Give it to you in the same way

25
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:51,920
After saying this, give it to me

26
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:53,510
I'm not short of money

27
00:00:53,510 --> 00:00:54,790
Why are you taking this back?

28
00:00:54,790 --> 00:00:56,510
Should I return the goods?

29
00:00:56,510 --> 00:00:59,310
Then you can come with me and let me go.

30
00:00:59,310 --> 00:01:03,080
The paper-tying master has arrived

31
00:01:03,080 --> 00:01:05,920
There's something wrong with Xiaocui's eyes

32
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:07,040
Xiaotian, come here quickly

33
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:08,360
I'm afraid this isn't Zha Shi.

34
00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:15,920
You're so close, you're dying

35
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:16,880
Willing to live or die

36
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:20,610
This is unspeakable

37
00:01:20,650 --> 00:01:21,730
Everyone, stay back and don't touch her.

38
00:01:21,730 --> 00:01:26,930
Lao Liu, why don't you burn some paper?

39
00:01:26,930 --> 00:01:28,890
Something's wrong, Lao Liu

40
00:01:28,890 --> 00:01:29,970
Think about it again

41
00:01:29,970 --> 00:01:31,850
Did the old man have anything else to do during his lifetime?
